        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"evandan55\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/48/2374_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> evandan55:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You helped 19 people, Cgrater?We should all send him flowers.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Maybe we could send the money to someone in the states to send him the flowers to avoid another international shipping, because if we don´t, I can see him helping us with the international shipping cost of the flowers XD</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thank you again! ^^</p>",
