        "created_at": "2012-11-30T18:09:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Tarao\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/c57346/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Tarao:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>evandan55 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>You helped 19 people, Cgrater?We should all send him flowers.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nMaybe we could send the money to someone in the states to send him the flowers to avoid another international shipping, because if we don´t, I can see him helping us with the international shipping cost of the flowers XD&nbsp;Thank you again! ^^\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>so 19* 40 =… carry the one… an amazing amount.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Cgrater: You are the Real-life Sentinel. Your kidness is limitless!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
