        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/cab0a1/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-01T10:48:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Indeed Cgrater thank you very much!! Not very people are so generous so as to spend two months worth of savings into getting more peopke to know a game.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ketigid\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ketigid:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[…] 19x($40+$35)=19x75=$1425 worth of pledges.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You are assuming that overseas backers only pledge for vengeance…and I know a few that are not, so my guess would be somewhere around 2k <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
